  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_09677d70-2e1c-4303-87d5-0125199ab8fa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"164\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>移除冰紋理中大部分的雜訊與反光&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>使其外觀更為簡潔</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_43208483-a2b1-413a-ac2f-16e84b9c9b40.png\" alt=\"截圖1\" width=\"683\" height=\"373\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_880a8168-2508-444c-9e1e-50b571d2669d.png\" alt=\"船\" width=\"44\" height=\"30\"> 專為冰上賽車體驗而設計</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2ef25486-acd2-4b40-8487-cade5c960f11.png\" alt=\"截圖2\" width=\"688\" height=\"376\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_801c5edb-d541-4aa4-b326-98f9659df1a4.png\" alt=\"方塊\" width=\"25\" height=\"27\"> 在一般世界中看起來也十分美觀</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_57dfdd5f-e904-4ef0-8ef8-4626ffc13292.png\" alt=\"冰雪\" width=\"756\" height=\"195\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text:left\">&nbsp;</p>",
